{"pin":"BH05630","subcodes":[{"code":"BH05630","anchor":"","first_line":"A single effulgence from among the effulgences of the Luminary of Knowledge hath shone forth from the horizon of the heaven of inner meanings, and countless books, both manifest and hidden, have appeared [3.5s]... ...My God, My Adored One! From Thee I came, and unto Thee have I returned. Illumine my heart","first_line_orig":"یک تجلی از تجلیات نیر علم از افق سماء معانی اشراق نمود کتب لاتحصی ظاهر و غیر  ","language":"Per","word_count":"180","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:082ax","source":"INBA30","locator":"082ax","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=45"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:025x","source":"INBA65","locator":"025x","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=27"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA81:013a","source":"INBA81","locator":"013a","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v081/?page=16"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"NLAI_BH_AB.017b","source":"NLAI_BH_AB","locator":"017b","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NLAI.BH_AB_misc.pdf#page=17"},{"kind":"music","code":"M. Torki","source":"M","locator":"Torki","url":"https://youtu.be/-whXmMeq72U"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.330","source":"AHM","locator":"330","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-330.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AKHA_136BE #07 p.110","source":"AKHA_136BE #07 p.110","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/akhbar-i-amri/"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.149x","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"149x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-151.html"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#053","source":"ADMS","locator":"053","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/bh05630/"}]},{"code":"BH05630TAK","anchor":"tak","translations":[{"language":"tr","lang_name":"Turkish"}]}]}
